# The real RFC distractor pool is pinned by provenance.json (committed): the
# exact RFC set, upstream sha256 of each, and the supersedes edges among them.
# RFCs are immutable, so the number + sha256 is the pin. The bulky verbatim
# corpus is rebuilt on demand and not committed —
#   python -m ingest.rfcs pool build --out scenarios_real/rfcs_pool
# regenerates it, and `pool verify` checks it reproduces.
corpus/
